{"4809140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "迷家mygohome", "steam_appid": 4809140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5083160], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 2D hand-drawn survival horror game: watch cameras, guard the door, manage your SAN—but maybe you’re no longer just hiding.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>At midnight, you wake up in a strange room. It doesn’t belong to you. But something outside wants to get in.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town is consuming its inhabitants. You are trapped, and your only “companion” is a rabbit doll of unknown origin in the corner. It seems to know many things—<strong>but can you really trust it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >· Core Gameplay: Choose Between Information and Sanity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the monitors to track the monster’s movements, and close doors or turn on lights at the right time. But every use of the monitors drains your SAN. You must choose between “seeing more” and “staying sane.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/3e6317802a68eef3dd422989b74fc79a.poster.avif?t=1787793157\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/3e6317802a68eef3dd422989b74fc79a.webm?t=1787793157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/3e6317802a68eef3dd422989b74fc79a.mp4?t=1787793157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/c34a320071da10901cb727bc95805fc4.poster.avif?t=1787793157\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/c34a320071da10901cb727bc95805fc4.webm?t=1787793157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/c34a320071da10901cb727bc95805fc4.mp4?t=1787793157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >· No Longer Just Hiding — Use Items Precisely and Parry the Monster’s Attacks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the third night onward, you will obtain the <strong>Crown</strong>. Use it at the moment the monster lunges to <strong>negate the attack and knock the monster back</strong>, with additional unexpected effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also items such as candles, medicine, and carrots, each of which can change your survival strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/110bc9b50aaca04b42cb35bbb51520ab.poster.avif?t=1787793157\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/110bc9b50aaca04b42cb35bbb51520ab.webm?t=1787793157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/110bc9b50aaca04b42cb35bbb51520ab.mp4?t=1787793157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >· Every Night Brings a New Nightmare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightning that cuts the power, a bloody hand reaching out of the bathtub, a monster bursting out of the room, sudden hallucinations… Every night adds new mechanics and new threats. You must keep adapting if you want to survive until dawn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/35e5dd3271254c330d303eee764b0382.poster.avif?t=1787793157\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/35e5dd3271254c330d303eee764b0382.webm?t=1787793157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/35e5dd3271254c330d303eee764b0382.mp4?t=1787793157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >· Secrets of the Day: Daydreams and NPCs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night you survive, you enter a “daydream.” There, you will meet new NPCs, obtain new items, and gradually piece together the truth of this world. Their words hide both truth and lies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/d9d890339f7b97fc3e2d476160474e84.poster.avif?t=1787793157\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/d9d890339f7b97fc3e2d476160474e84.webm?t=1787793157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/d9d890339f7b97fc3e2d476160474e84.mp4?t=1787793157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work to collect hidden items and reach the <strong>true ending</strong> of this world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >· A Hand-Drawn World Made by One Person</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All art is hand-drawn by a single creator, with frame-by-frame refined animation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >· About Playtime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full playthrough takes about 60–90 minutes: compact and tightly paced. It’s suitable for finishing in one sitting, or for replaying with different strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >· Finally, a Word from the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first game I have made entirely on my own. It isn’t perfect, but I poured my heart into it. Thank you for being willing to enter this world.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 2D hand-drawn survival horror game: watch cameras, guard the door, manage your SAN—but maybe you’re no longer just hiding.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>At midnight, you wake up in a strange room. It doesn’t belong to you. But something outside wants to get in.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town is consuming its inhabitants. You are trapped, and your only “companion” is a rabbit doll of unknown origin in the corner. It seems to know many things—<strong>but can you really trust it?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >· Core Gameplay: Choose Between Information and Sanity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the monitors to track the monster’s movements, and close doors or turn on lights at the right time. But every use of the monitors drains your SAN. You must choose between “seeing more” and “staying sane.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/3e6317802a68eef3dd422989b74fc79a.poster.avif?t=1787793157\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/3e6317802a68eef3dd422989b74fc79a.webm?t=1787793157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/3e6317802a68eef3dd422989b74fc79a.mp4?t=1787793157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/extras/c34a320071da1