ting, or for replaying with different strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >· Finally, a Word from the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the first game I have made entirely on my own. It isn’t perfect, but I poured my heart into it. Thank you for being willing to enter this world.</p>", "short_description": "mygohome is a Lovecraftian psychological horror game. A remote town is being consumed by an unknown presence. You awaken in a strange room. Something is drawing near. Survive five nights. Your only companion is a rabbit doll. It knows everything. But can you trust it?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/d36877b0abfb1f57a6061cd73512d0eeda972ac0/header.jpg?t=1787793157", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/3465853572646b49051fce456dce528a85c2d658/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787793157", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4809140/3465853572646b49051fce456dce528a85c2d658/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787793157", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> win7/win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Dual-Core (Intel Core 2 Duo or AMD Athlon 64 X2)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> win7/win10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700KF 